QViC-MF-Train
=============

An unofficial reconstruction of the training code for QViC-MF (CVPR 2026).
This repository is not affiliated with, authored by, or endorsed by Fujitsu
Research, Macquarie University, or the paper's authors.


Upstream material
-----------------

The following are redistributed **verbatim** from the official QViC-MF release,
https://github.com/FujitsuResearch/QViC-MF (commit 3624d1e8df8e13128dc2d331d280bf3aebb42428):

    qvic/__init__.py
    qvic/constants.py
    qvic/conversation.py
    qvic/mm_utils.py
    qvic/utils.py
    qvic/eval/**
    qvic/model/**

    Copyright (c) 2026 Fujitsu Limited and the QViC-MF authors.
    Licensed under CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0. See LICENSE.

That code in turn derives from LLaVA-NeXT (https://github.com/LLaVA-VL/LLaVA-NeXT)
and vendors EVA-CLIP under qvic/model/multimodal_encoder/; those files carry
their original notices.

Not redistributed here: the upstream lmms-eval fork, playground/, scripts/eval/,
and the result-analysis helpers under upstream scripts/. Obtain them from the
upstream repository.


